Package: mcp-hub-tools
Version: 0.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssh-client, curl
Maintainer: sepisotoni <ndili.mqeni@gmail.com>
Description: MCP Hub Tools - Linux server-side agent for Claude MCP
 Provides hub-cli, hub-diagnostics, and hub-monitor for managing
 PC tunnel connections and auto-discovery from a home Linux server.
 .
 hub-cli: manage SSH tunnel configs and Render env vars
 hub-diagnostics: local health checks and connectivity tests
 hub-monitor: HTTP listener for PC self-registration + 5-min poll
 pc-tunnel@.service: systemd template for per-PC SSH tunnels
